<title>NEW ZEALAND: PRI blocked from buying Air NZ catering business.</title>
<headline>PRI blocked from buying Air NZ catering business.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>New Zealand's Commerce Commission on Wednesday declined to clear PRI Flight Catering Ltd to acquire the flight catering business of Air New Zealand Ltd.</p>
<p>Commission Chairman Alan Bollard said he was not satisfied the proposal would not lead to dominance being acquired or strengthened in the market for in-flight catering for domestic and international flights.</p>
</text>
